# Specification Query Pattern

Use when dynamic filtering is required.

Guidelines:
- keep filter DTO explicit, typed, and validation-aware
- centralize predicate composition in dedicated specification/builder classes
- keep controllers thin by delegating filter logic
- keep pagination/sorting explicit and predictable

Quality checks:
- avoid repository method explosion for combinatorial filter variants
- normalize case/text matching intentionally
- ensure performance-sensitive filters have index-aware query strategy
